# The formatter reads only the `.gitignore` at its working directory, never a nested one, so a
# root-run pass reaches every subject a nested file excludes. Each nested `.gitignore` entry that the
# root one does not already carry is repeated here. Anchored with `**/` rather than pinned to the one
# path that exists today, so a second package is excluded with no edit.

# Build and generated output.
**/dist/
**/.docusaurus/
**/.cache-loader/

# Test-runner output and staging.
**/test-results/
**/playwright-report/
**/.staged-extensions/

# Local environment files and debug logs.
**/.env.local
**/.env.development.local
**/.env.test.local
**/.env.production.local
**/npm-debug.log*
**/yarn-debug.log*
**/yarn-error.log*

# Tracked, so no ignore file excludes it, and rewriting it produces a diff no one reads.
**/package-lock.json

# Wire snapshots are compared byte for byte, so reformatting one rewrites what the test expects
# rather than tidying it. They carry their own WIRE_SNAPSHOT_UPDATE path for the deliberate case.
**/Renamer.Tests/Contracts/fixtures/

# Written verbatim by the emitter and diffed by CI; reformatting it makes that diff permanent.
**/wire/openapi.json

# Generated from that document.
**/src/wire/
